  "updated_at": "2026-10-28T21:29:19Z",
  "body": "> . A model's subscribe only emits when directly set programmatically.\n\nThe [documentation](https://angular.dev/api/core/ModelSignal#subscribe) says:\n\n> Registers a callback that is invoked whenever the output emits a new value of type T.\n\nThere is no mention about it only working in specific cases. So this should be documented.",
